        <section class="category-header">
            <h1>Budgeting Calculators</h1>
            <p class="lead">Manage your money effectively. Our free budgeting calculators help you track your income and expenses, create a personalized budget, and work towards your financial goals.</p>
        </section>

        <div class="calculator-grid">
            <div class="calculator-card">
                <div class="calculator-icon"><i class="fas fa-calendar-alt"></i></div> <h3><a href="/finance/budgeting/monthly-budget-calculator/">Monthly Budget Calculator</a></h3>
